<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[subpath1]/[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><section id="guide-to-start-your-own-small-business" class="page-header page-header--standard" index="0" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__container" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__content" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__text-content" data-v-93adf07f><!----><h1 class="page-header__title" data-v-93adf07f>Guide to start your own small business</h1><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Starting your own small business can be daunting, but with Evri’s simple guide you’ll be set up in no time. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="page-header__media" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__media-text-image" data-v-93adf07f><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/a67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/a67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/a67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/a67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Business" width="300" height="45" class="page-header__text-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-93adf07f></div></div></div><!----></section><section id="what-is-a-small-business?" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Two female business owners in a stock room seen handling parcels and smiling" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>What is a small business?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A small business is an independently owned and operated company with a small number of employees and lower revenue compared to larger corporations.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Small businesses can take many forms, including online shops, freelance services, local retail stores, and home-based businesses. They are a key part of the UK economy and are often built around flexibility, creativity and personal interests.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="2" data-v-4131e9ee data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-4131e9ee><div data-v-4131e9ee data-v-46f2ddf6><div id="how-to-start-a-small-business" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-46f2ddf6><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-46f2ddf6>How to start a small business</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-46f2ddf6>If you’re wondering how to start a small business, breaking it down into steps makes the process much more manageable:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Choose your idea</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Think about your skills, interests and gaps in the market. The best small businesses often solve a problem or fulfil a specific need as well as work alongside an interest or passion.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Research your market</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Look into your target audience, competitors and pricing. This is especially important when learning how to start a small business in the UK, where local demand and trends vary. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Create a business plan</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Outline your goals, costs and growth strategy. This doesn’t need to be complicated, but it should give you a direction.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>4</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Register your business</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Decide whether you’ll operate as a sole trader, partnership, or limited company, and register with <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://www.gov.uk/set-up-business" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->HMRC<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> if required.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>5</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Organise delivery and shipping</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you will be sending out physical products, decide who you will choose as your courier (Evri, of course!) and set up an <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/frequent-seller" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->account with them.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>6</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Launch your business</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Build your website, set up social media, and start promoting your products or services.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="small-business-ideas" class="section-wrapper" index="3" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aTKam3NYClf9n2Of_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377_bulksendscreenOption1a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aTKam3NYClf9n2Of_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377_bulksendscreenOption1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aTKam3NYClf9n2Of_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377_bulksendscreenOption1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aTKam3NYClf9n2Of_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377_bulksendscreenOption1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Small business ideas</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Looking for some inspiration? Here are some popular small business ideas to get you started: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Online retail (e.g. clothing or handmade goods) <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Dropshipping businesses <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Freelance services (writing, design) <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Subscription boxes <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Delivery driving and courier services <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tutoring or online courses <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The best idea is to combine your passion with demand in the market.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-4131e9ee data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-4131e9ee><div data-v-4131e9ee data-v-46f2ddf6><div id="small-business-considerations" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-46f2ddf6><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-46f2ddf6>Small business considerations</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-46f2ddf6>Before launching your business, there are several important small business considerations to keep in mind:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__avatar" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-icon link-block__avatar-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="calculator" data-test-id="calculator" data-v-66bd53df data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>calculator</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M23.66 2.28H8.34C7.83 2.28 7.41 2.7 7.41 3.21V28.79C7.41 29.3 7.83 29.72 8.34 29.72H23.66C24.17 29.72 24.