 18.81 14.35 18.81 13.57C18.81 12.79 19.45 12.15 20.23 12.15Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M20.57 4.92C21.14 4.92 21.61 5.39 21.61 5.96V8.42C21.61 8.99 21.14 9.46 20.57 9.46H11.43C10.86 9.46 10.39 8.99 10.39 8.42V5.96C10.39 5.39 10.86 4.92 11.43 4.92H20.57Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M22.21 1.04C24.17 1.04 25.76 2.63 25.76 4.59V27.4C25.76 29.36 24.17 30.95 22.21 30.95H9.8C7.84 30.95 6.25 29.36 6.25 27.4V4.59C6.25 2.63 7.84 1.04 9.8 1.04H22.21ZM9.79 2.6C8.69 2.6 7.8 3.49 7.8 4.59V27.41C7.8 28.51 8.69 29.4 9.79 29.4H22.2C23.3 29.4 24.19 28.51 24.19 27.41V4.59C24.19 3.49 23.3 2.6 22.2 2.6H9.79Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Small business finance</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Starting a small business often requires some upfront investment, dependent on the type of business you are starting. Consider costs such as buying stock, website setup if you are paying someone to do this for you, marketing and shipping. You may choose to self-fund, apply for a small business loan or explore grants that are available for small businesses.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__avatar" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-icon link-block__avatar-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="laptops" data-test-id="laptops" data-v-66bd53df data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Laptops</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M28.57 22.7V6.82C28.57 6.28 28.14 5.85 27.6 5.85L4.39 5.85C3.85 5.85 3.42 6.28 3.42 6.82V22.7C3.42 23.24 3.85 23.67 4.39 23.67H27.6C28.14 23.67 28.57 23.24 28.57 22.7Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M32 24.43C32 25.69 30.98 26.71 29.72 26.71H2.28C1.02 26.71 0 25.69 0 24.43V23.32H32V24.43ZM12.6 24.39C12.25 24.39 11.97 24.67 11.97 25.02C11.97 25.37 12.25 25.65 12.6 25.65H19.39C19.74 25.65 20.02 25.37 20.02 25.02C20.02 24.67 19.74 24.39 19.39 24.39H12.6Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M26.54 4.52C28.25 4.52 29.64 5.91 29.64 7.62V21.94C29.64 22.37 29.3 22.71 28.87 22.71C28.44 22.71 28.1 22.36 28.1 21.94V7.62C28.1 6.76 27.4 6.06 26.54 6.06H5.47C4.61 6.06 3.91 6.76 3.91 7.62V21.94C3.91 22.37 3.56 22.71 3.14 22.71H3.13C2.7 22.71 2.36 22.36 2.36 21.94V7.62C2.36 5.91 3.75 4.52 5.46 4.52H26.54Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M10.31 12.31L6.5 15.77L5.82 15L9.63 11.54L10.31 12.31Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M9.94 10.15L6.92 12.9L6.25 12.13L9.26 9.38L9.94 10.15Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M11.97 8.3L10.29 9.84L9.62 9.07L11.3 7.54L11.97 8.3Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Small business marketing</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Marketing for small businesses can be key to early visibility and success. Marketing will help you attract and retain customers and reach your target audience to grow your business. Some marketing strategies you could think about are; social media marketing, email marketing campaigns, paid advertising and influencer collaborations. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper wrapper--white" index="5" data-v-4131e9ee data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-4131e9ee><div data-v-4131e9ee data-v-6df0be74><div id="small-business-shipping-in-the-uk-–-how-evri-can-support-you" class="photo-list__text-container" data-v-6df0be74><h2 class="photo-list__title" data-v-6df0be74>Small business shipping in the UK – How Evri can support you</h2><p class="photo-list__desc" data-v-6df0be74>When you’re starting a small business where you will be sending out physical products, ensuring you have reliable and efficient shipping is a key to your business&#39; success. With Evri, your small business can benefit from:</p></div><!--[--><div class="link-block__item" data-v-6df0be74 data-v-cc41125a><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI2JbqstJ9-TfS_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2384.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is holding a blue hand-held device to scan the customer&#39;s parcel." width="5271" height="3460" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-cc41125a><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-cc41125a><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-cc41125a><!----> Competitive parcel delivery prices</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/our-prices" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri pricing,<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> you’ll be choosing a competitive and affordable delivery service whilst still giving a high standard of care when delivering your parcels.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-6df0be74 data-v-cc41125a><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/agSEu6YofJOwHMcU_Asset3_1200x628a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/agSEu6YofJOwHMcU_Asset3_1200x628.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/agSEu6YofJOwHMcU_Asset3_1200x628.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/agSEu6YofJOwHMcU_Asset3_1200x628.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A person wearing headphones places a parcel into a blue Evri Locker unit outside a modern building in an urban area." width="1200" height="628" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-cc41125a><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-cc41125a><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-cc41125a><!----> Flexible drop-off options</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you want to drop off your parcels contact-free or get help at a ParcelShop, Evri has a great option for you. Find a local <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/find-an-evri-location" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->drop-off point near you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-6df0be74 data-v-cc41125a><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZuGsTxoQrfVKl-oJ_Trackphone1a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZuGsTxoQrfVKl-oJ_Trackphone1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZuGsTxoQrfVKl-oJ_Trackphone1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/ZuGsTxoQrfVKl-oJ_Trackphone1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="608" height="342" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-cc41125a><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-cc41125a><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-cc41125a><!----> Parcel tracking for peace of mind</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When choosing Evri, you’ll get a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->tracking link<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> included in the price to make sure you and your customers can know where their parcel is and be ready for its arrival.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-6df0be74 data-v-cc41125a><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uKoZbqstJ9-DAR_Customerreceivingparcel-2-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, smiling as they are handed a parcel from the courier." width="1000" height="680" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-cc41125a><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-cc41125a><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-cc41125a><!----> Parcel cover</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri includes up to £20 cover for free*. This will give you the peace of mind, that your parcel is safe and can be compensated if something goes wrong. *Excludes Postable parcels.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-6df0be74 data-v-cc41125a><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aPd8KbpReVYa3g39_Frequentsellera942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aPd8KbpReVYa3g39_Frequentseller.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aPd8KbpReVYa3g39_Frequentseller.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aPd8KbpReVYa3g39_Frequentseller.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A small business owner using laptop to send parcels" width="1001" height="667" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-cc41125a><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-cc41125a><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-cc41125a><!----> Frequent Seller Account</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Once your business starts to grow and you’re sending more than 40 parcels per month, you can sign up to a Frequent Seller Account giving you up to 50% savings on standard and next day delivery parcels. Find out more about how your small business can benefit from a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/frequent-seller" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Frequent Seller Account here.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="becoming-a-courier" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abpmU7bci2UF6Kff_Couriertippinga942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abpmU7bci2UF6Kff_Couriertipping.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abpmU7bci2UF6Kff_Couriertipping.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/abpmU7bci2UF6Kff_Couriertipping.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Becoming a courier</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Are you looking for a flexible income stream to supplement for your small business? Becoming an Evri courier is perfect, working flexible hours, choosing your delivery volume and familiar routes, you can get a perfect work-life balance. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/careers/be-a-courier" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.9